    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29631" root="عطو" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطَا</span></b> , [aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعْطُو</span>,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطْوٌ</span>: see 6, first
quarter, in five places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence] one says
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوِيلٌ لَا تَعْطُوهُ الأَيَادِى</span> [<i>High,</i> so that <i>the hands
will not reach it</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطْوٌ</span> signifies
also The act of <i>raising the head and the hands</i>
(K, TA) <i>to take a thing.</i> (TA.) See also an ex.
in a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْ</span>, p. 106, first col. [And
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطْوٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاطٍ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاطَيْنَا فَعَطَوْتُهُ</span>: see 6.

